{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14216120","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14216120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421612001:1":{"text":"顔を見せてちょうだい！怪我は？印は？","source_cn":"米娜，让我看看你！没有受伤，也没有被施加印记！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADEA2527307B3AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421612002:1":{"text":"無事で何よりだわ……ずっと心配してたんだから！","source_cn":"你没事真是太好了！我一直在担心你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B28102BC1B486F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421612003:1":{"text":"危ない目に遭いかけたけど、エイヴンとマーリン様のおかげで助かったの。","source_cn":"我在野外遇到了危险，幸好埃文和这位梅林大人及时找到了我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DFAEE95BB27318","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"危ない目に遭いかけたけど、エイヴンとマーリン様のおかげで助かったの。","female":"危ない目に遭いかけたけど、エイヴンとマーリン様のおかげで助かったの。","variant_male_record_index":"163849","variant_female_record_index":"163850","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421612004:1":{"text":"それよりデイリン、ココナッツオイルってまだ残ってる？エイヴンが急ぎで入り用なんだけど、市場でもう手に入らなくて……","source_cn":"不说这些了，德琳，你这里有没有多余的香椰油？埃文有急用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF9D9FFA074DECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421612005:1":{"text":"あるにはあるけど、本当にわずかよ……まあいいわ、持っていって。","source_cn":"有是有，但只剩下最后一点了……没事，你拿走吧！先帮埃文...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9906034596A51798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421612006:1":{"text":"でも、もしあなたのご主人様にバレたら……","source_cn":"如果被你的主人发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82A3DEE5DCAC2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421612007:1":{"text":"その時は、またあなたたちに助けてもらうわよ！見捨てないでね？","source_cn":"如果被发现，我再来找你们帮忙嘛！等那个时候，你可不要不管我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047DE8E42E371FDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421612008:1":{"text":"分かった、じゃあ先にエイヴンと合流するわね。すべて片付いたら、彼からお礼しに来ると思うわ！","source_cn":"我明白了，我先去市集找埃文，事情解决后他一定会亲自来感...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87121B95977D6BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女仆德琳":{"text":"メイドのデイリン","source":"女仆德琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女仆米娜":{"text":"メイドのミナ","source":"女仆米娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}